			"notes": "---\n## [2.0.0](https://github.com/CraftShot-net/Fabric-Mod/compare/v1.0.4..2.0.0) - 2026-11-03\n\n### Chores\n\n\n- **(release)** prepare 2.0.0 - ([edb4b9d](https://github.com/CraftShot-net/Fabric-Mod/commit/edb4b9dedeb9e794ff455df623e1eda2adbbe317)) - Timeox2k\n\n\n\n### Features\n\n\n\n- CraftProxy's social menu and a login that keeps the Minecraft token local - ([caf1370](https://github.com/CraftShot-net/Fabric-Mod/commit/caf13707208329acf555ade0dc1dfb9ddcea5b74)) - Timeox2k\n\n### Fixes\n\n\n\n- fix message that came from the main menu is not visible ingame - ([5ec2062](https://github.com/CraftShot-net/Fabric-Mod/commit/5ec2062a6a62aa4e175386274f41173294fed14f)) - Timeox2k\n\n### Other\n\n\n\n- improve caching + fix race condition - ([dcad613](https://github.com/CraftShot-net/Fabric-Mod/commit/dcad613aabf41ff5a94c29837f175832a2fea69e)) - Timeox2k\n- not depend on fabricapi anymore (hopefully) - ([7dd648b](https://github.com/CraftShot-net/Fabric-Mod/commit/7dd648b909648a54fc39a3dd7a57ed65bdba403a)) - Timeox2k\n- bump mod_version - ([57b3153](https://github.com/CraftShot-net/Fabric-Mod/commit/57b315379732e50a6e5e2ab3824b8bf3680f13ef)) - Timeox2k\n- Upgrade to 26.2 - ([58401ee](https://github.com/CraftShot-net/Fabric-Mod/commit/58401ee64bfb6b54fb2ce8b68b67056de6c0d9c8)) - Timeox2k\n- bump gradle - ([456c0e8](https://github.com/CraftShot-net/Fabric-Mod/commit/456c0e8f047df3372f931875392e7fba0b7920ec)) - Timeox2k\n- remove unused feature - ([6c9ac3e](https://github.com/CraftShot-net/Fabric-Mod/commit/6c9ac3e20ab6cc4c3c0208c98a54532ca525f285)) - Timeox2k\n- Bump version - ([1148557](https://github.com/CraftShot-net/Fabric-Mod/commit/1148557ac39a7f3a6c420e1d3bc9f45e10e6924c)) - Timeox2k\n- Rewritten Auth System for improved privacy and security - ([fc67af0](https://github.com/CraftShot-net/Fabric-Mod/commit/fc67af037bd7d1e97c896325ba5974a74003bff4)) - Timeox2k\n- Update gradle.properties - ([846d33c](https://github.com/CraftShot-net/Fabric-Mod/commit/846d